    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 30.</p><p><strong>Mastered School.</strong> Choose one of the eight schools of magic: Abjuration, Conjuration, Divination, Enchantment, Evocation, Illusion, Necromancy, or Transmutation. Your choice grants you the following features.</p><p><strong>Rote Casting.</strong> Choose a level 1 spell of the chosen school from the spell list of your class. You always have it prepared and can cast it without a spell slot or components.</p><p><strong>Signature Arcanum.</strong> Choose a spell of level 7 or lower from the chosen school. You always have it prepared, and you can cast it once without a spell slot, regaining that use when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>You can also cast these prepared spells with any spell slots of the appropriate level you have.</p><p><strong>Repeatable.</strong> You can take this feat more than once, but you must choose a different school of magic each time.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-0uwVOTRR96i7DOtA\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Pick both spells from the school you chose (level 7 or lower for the Signature Arcanum). The Rote Casting spell is cast without a slot at will.</p></section>",
